            'PRIOR KNOWLEDGE: Pupils have completed learning activities related to the selected topics before the assessment.',
            'TEACHING AND LEARNING MATERIALS: Summative test paper, answer booklet or answer spaces, pencils, eraser and other permitted stationery.',
            'CROSS-CURRICULAR ELEMENTS / VALUES: Integrity, responsibility, self-discipline and time management.',
            'HOTS / 21ST CENTURY LEARNING: Individual application of language knowledge and skills; no collaborative activity during the assessment.',
